{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And these are the children of Anah: Dishon and Oholibamah daughter of Anah.</b> This is not the Anah mentioned at the beginning of the verse, for if it were he, what need would there be to mention him? Rather, it is the Anah mentioned in the first verse."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:06.901340820Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}